 is an integral class $c\\in K_3(A)$ such that\n\\[\n c|_{\\Frac A}=0,\n \\qquad\n c|_{A[1/\\pi]}\\bmod5\\ne0\n \\quad\\text{in }G_3(A[1/\\pi];\\Z/5).\n\\]\nIn particular, $K_3(A)\\to K_3(\\Frac A)$ is not injective."},{"appendix":false,"contribution_target":{"fingerprint":"sha256:9ab6137f58dd447590295b6ae3685e5154a3dc4fcdc8b208c6a84ba01b58e793","grain":"paper-statement","id":"An-Integral-Degree-Three-Gersten-Counterexample-September-26-2026#prop:integral","title":"prop:integral"},"credit":{"kind":"producer-declared","license":null,"license_status":"consult-source-notice","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","repository":"https://github.com/openai/math","source":"lean/formalization.yaml","source_registry":"index.json#/sources"},"detail":{"path":"../rows/de3de0d2899ee6419bfb44ca.json","pointer":"/row"},"display":"Proposition","id":"r:An-Integral-Degree-Three-Gersten-Counterexample-September-26-2026:prop:integral","manuscript_id":"p:An-Integral-Degree-Three-Gersten-Counterexample-September-26-2026","name":"prop:integral","printed_number":"3.1","printed_number_provenance":{"atlas_pin":"8056826bbd00caea871ad036bd295182e2bef3e2","binding":{"file":"build/sections/integral-class.tex","label":"prop:integral","line":41,"manuscript":"An-Integral-Degree-Three-Gersten-Counterexample-September-26-2026","statement_sha256":"76c8bec2ea87b9c02737c8de433e3bea4a1f8e287d55b47026f8f544bf7ae906"},"blob_sha256":"sha256:253ae0683558fd095a71d6f47ab0694d8d98b846c1a65d2bbf9b145d484af567","kind":"reading-page-computed","pdf_verified":false,"pin":"8056826bbd00caea871ad036bd295182e2bef3e2","renderer":"scripts/build_papers.py","source":"data/statement_numbers.json","upstream_pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb"},"printed_number_status":"recorded","reading_page":"papers/An-Integral-Degree-Three-Gersten-Counterexample-September-26-2026.html#prop:integral","section":3,"section_title":"Lifting on the divisor","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-remove